{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:48.772486+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Technically `pjit` is not supposed to work on CPU, because XLA SPMD partitioner doesn't support CPU. So while this is an error, it's just a bad manifestation of another problem. I opened #7931 to track that.","created_at":"2021-09-16T13:02:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923#issuecomment-920880649","id":920880649,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc4244YJ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/920880649/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-09-16T13:02:05Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/920880649","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4583066?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apaszke","id":4583066,"login":"apaszke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODMwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"When printing the output of a `pjit` on a CPU with forced devices via `xla_force_host_platform_device_count`  there is an error of the form:\r\n> ValueError: could not broadcast input array from shape (...) into shape (...)\r\n\r\nThis can be reproduced even with the example from `pjit` docs:\r\n\r\n```\r\nx = jnp.arange(8, dtype=jnp.float32)\r\nf = pjit(\r\n    lambda x: jax.numpy.convolve(x, jnp.asarray([0.5, 1.0, 0.5]), 'same'),\r\n    in_axis_resources=None, \r\n    out_axis_resources=PartitionSpec('devices')\r\n)\r\nwith mesh(jax.devices(), ('devices',)):\r\n  print(f(x))\r\n```\r\nWhich leads to an error: `<...> from shape (8) into shape (1)` with a stack trace as follows:\r\n\r\n```\r\n.../jax/interpreters/pxla.py in _sda_value(self)\r\n    613     npy_value = np.empty(self.aval.shape, self.aval.dtype)\r\n    614     for i in self.one_replica_buffer_indices:\r\n--> 615       npy_value[self.indices[i]] = self.device_buffers[i].to_py()\r\n    616     self._npy_value = npy_value\r\n    617   return self._npy_value\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt seems there are device_count=8 device buffers each containing an array of shape `(8,)` whereas `npy_value` takes on just the aval shape which is `(8,)` so naturally an array of shape `(8,)` fails to fit into a sub-array `(1,)`.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen running on a TPU or GPU the output is as expected.","closed_at":"2021-09-16T13:02:05Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4583066?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apaszke","id":4583066,"login":"apaszke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODMwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923/comments","created_at":"2021-09-15T17:14:55Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923","id":997327582,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc47cgLe","number":7923,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":"completed","sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923/timeline","title":"ValueError when printing output of pjit on a CPU","type":null,"updated_at":"2021-09-16T13:02:05Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/7923","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inoryy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inoryy/followers","following_url":"https://api.